{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04296","headline":"秋日于天中寺寻复礼上人 · 武三思","name":"秋日于天中寺寻复礼上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙域三时殿，香岩七宝宫。\n金绳先界道，玉柄即谈空。\n喻筏知何极，传灯竟不穷。\n弥天高义远，初地胜因通。\n理诣归一处，心行不二中。\n有无双惑遣，真俗两缘同。\n摘叶疑焚翠，投花若散红。\n网珠遥映日，檐铎近吟风。\n定沼寒光素，禅枝暝色葱。\n愿随方便力，长冀释尘笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武三思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}